	(text "SENSOR INTERFACES\nSeparate physical SDA/SCL pairs; RP2040 I2C controllers are reused by pin selection.\nAll addresses are 7-bit: Hall 0x35, Temp 0x48, Color 0x10, IMU 0x68.\nEach sensor is on its own sheet. Sensor interrupt lines are not routed to the MCU.\nI2C pullups: 4.7k to 3V3; initial bus speed 100 kHz.\nRise-time estimate: t_r = 0.8473 x R_P x C_bus.\nFor a 300 ns target and 4.7k, C_bus <= 75 pF nominal; verify on hardware." (at 18 18 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3ba43c7f-209a-5632-afed-3ad2919b0b9b"))
)
